Package: dssatcalibrator
Type: Package
Title: Monte-Carlo and Bayesian Calibration Framework for DSSAT-CSM
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Alwin", "Hopf", email = "alwinhopf@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Alwin Hopf
Maintainer: Alwin Hopf <alwinhopf@gmail.com>
Description: Config-driven Monte-Carlo and Bayesian calibration of DSSAT-CSM
    cultivar/ecotype/species coefficients (and optionally management, soil and
    weather) against observed LAI, biomass, grain yield and phenology, across one
    or many experiments. R twin of the Python package; identical public function
    names and a shared config.yaml so the two stay in lock-step (parity is a
    contract, enforced by cross-language tests).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
